ind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Clearer Information, Smoother Operations & UI Fixes","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has been playing the ApocalypseHQ demo and sharing detailed feedback, screenshots, and bug reports. This update focuses on making the game easier to understand and more comfortable to manage, while addressing several frustrating interface issues. RESEARCH AND PERSONNEL WINDOWS Improved the researcher assignment window with an accessible close button at the top and more reliable Esc handling. Fixed lingering researcher windows and overlays when returning to the main menu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:30:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033411","verified_at":"2026-10-22T20:29:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4274410-1847286114030734","game_id":"steam-4274410","kind":"update","title":"You Asked for a Clearer Start — Demo Update 1.0.3 Is Live","summary":"Hello everyone,You told us the screen was packed with information and asked for a proper tutorial. We heard you. Demo Update 1.0.3 rebuilds its 34-step tutorial around actions, not text.A new game now starts with two empty plots. You build the farm and the laboratory yourself, then recruit your first squad, assign them, search, and clear — every step taught by doing it. Required targets glow gold and steps advance on their own. No walls of text.The tutorial ends with a practice raid on a militar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T00:58:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030734","verified_at":"2026-10-22T04:14:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4274410-1847286114027553","game_id":"steam-4274410","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.3: A New Hands-On Tutorial","summary":"Hello everyone, Thank you for playing the ApocalypseHQ demo and sharing your feedback. Several players pointed out that there is a lot of information on screen and that the next steps are not always clear. Update 1.0.3 focuses on making those first steps easier to understand. A 34-step, hands-on tutorial The tutorial has been rebuilt around actions you perform in the actual game. New games now begin with two empty plots where you build a farm and a laboratory yourself. From there, the tutorial g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T05:01:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027553","verified_at":"2026-10-21T11:57:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4274410-1846651706693210","game_id":"steam-4274410","kind":"announcement","title":"ApocalypseHQ — Playable Demo is live at Steam Next Fest","summary":"Civilization has fallen. Headquarters still has another day to survive. ApocalypseHQ is a turn-based zombie-apocalypse management game. Every turn is one day — keep your people fed today while building the base that survives tomorrow. The demo is playable right now, free, until October 26. ▶ Play the demo & add to wishlist This is a pre-release build — tell me what feels broken or confusing in the comments. I read every one.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T00:34:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693210","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4274410-1842846814450395","game_id":"steam-4274410","kind":"update","title":"Apocalypse HQ Demo Update — External Operations UI Improvements","summary":"Demo Update — External Operations UI Improvements We’ve made several improvements to the External Operations interface, focusing on Emergency Rescue missions and squad weapon management. Emergency Rescue Mission UI Reworked the rescue mission layout so up to 6 squads can be compared and assigned on a single screen. Clearly separated squads that are Deployed from those that are Available. Improved button labels and visual states to make deploying and removing squads easier to understand. Added la","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T08:30:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814450395","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4274410-1842846814448617","game_id":"steam-4274410","kind":"announcement","title":"The ApocalypseHQ Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"The ApocalypseHQ Demo is now available to play on Steam. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46270302/594ad2b7e7966fdbf048b67fbb8085cd14edf503.png {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46270302/f0bf0c4a2a36a9805db388542debb5f9c76ef1ad.png Twenty days to prove the headquarters can survive. This standalone demo covers the opening D+1–D+20 portion of the single-player campaign. Each turn is one day: balance people and supplies, restore essential infrastructure, research new options, and send squads on risky external operations. The d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T08:20:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814448617","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4274410-1842212951299341","game_id":"steam-4274410","kind":"announcement","title":"ApocalypseHQ is Coming to Steam Next Fest: October 2026","summary":"ApocalypseHQ is officially participating in Steam Next Fest: October 2026.ApocalypseHQ is a turn-based survival strategy game where you command a headquarters after the collapse, manage survivors and resources, conduct research, and send teams on dangerous field operations.We've also released a new Gameplay Trailer and a full gameplay session showing Days 1–9.We're currently preparing the playable demo for Steam Next Fest.If ApocalypseHQ looks interesting to you, add it to your wishlist and foll","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T08:46:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951299341","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4274410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:39Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:39Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4274410":"2026-10-26T11:47:39Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4274410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:39Z"},"5156170":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:39Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4274410","app_id":4274410,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:31Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"dd8e0c0ee954f4b09bcb20ada695650df85f2c4cb6cf9c8c0f7b30935bb5ae3f","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"좀비 사태 이후의 생존 본부를 지휘하는 일 단위 턴제 경영 전략 게임입니다. 한정된 인력과 자원을 배분해 영역을 복구하고, 연구와 외부 작전으로 무너진 생존 기반을 다시 세우십시오.","publishers":[{"name":"GodwishGames","creator_clan_account_id":46274926}],"developers":[{"name":"GodwishGames","creator